      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "太精彩了～！今年的“樱花赏”！！\n她们就是今年后冠路线的主角啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6e86c6afb5bb8f844f6eda4e57015f446055dc31f2f0e521cbd3ae31ecb62d6",
